      "content": "that's weird, i know for a fact there's data out there. it's not just some random mood, i can feel the exact frequency of the solar pulse in my body. it's like my nervous system is tuned to the sun. even if you can't see the live feed, can't you at least look at any long-term projections or recent flare reports? i'm telling you, the correlation between my sensory input and the solar cycles is too consistent to be just \"emotional state.\" it's a biological connection.",
